      "created_at": "2017-12-01T23:57:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone! A friend and I recently got the digital version of SC RPG, and as big fans of SotM we're super-excited to play it. We just have the problem that we don't have enough players for a group yet.</p><p><span>Would anyone be interested in forming a group for online play, through voice chat? We could use an app like Discord or Roll20 or another such program that you'd care to recommend. Our best available times are between about 9pm to 3am EST (2am-8am GMT/UTC)</span></p><p>We haven't decided who the GM would be yet, so that position's open if you want it!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:31.890Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
